# Long-form documentation for this fork. Upstream's prettier config collapses
# each paragraph onto one line, which makes a one-word change rewrite the whole
# paragraph and turns the diff of a spec into noise. These are hand-wrapped and
# reviewed as prose; prettier still owns the code and config files.
